<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in Italian first</p>
<p>division after matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>9 - Abel Balbo (Roma)</p>
<p>8 - Felippo Inzaghi (Atalanta), Pasquale Luiso (Piacenza)</p>
<p>7 - George Weah (Milan)</p>
<p>6 - Gabriel Batistuta (Fiorentina), Oliver Bierhoff (Udinese),</p>
<p>Roberto Mancini (Sampdoria), Marcello Otero (Vicenza)</p>
<p>5 - Alfredo Aglietti (Napoli), Enrico Chiesa (Parma), Youri</p>
<p>Djorkaeff (Inter), Igor Kolyvanov (Bologna), Luis Oliveira</p>
<p>(Fiorentina), Giuseppe Signori (Lazio)</p>
<p>4 - Roberto Baggio (Milan), Nicola Caccia (Napoli), Paolo Poggi</p>
<p>(Udinese), Sandro Tovalieri (Reggiana)</p>
